WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:01,750
Sister Wang

2
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:06,390
What did the big boss say about following us to your hometown?

3
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:08,390
The safe zones are all in the north

4
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,390
Your hometown is also in the north

5
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:10,390
Just on the way

6
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,390
I want to form a formal alliance with you

7
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,390
Each retains the right to command

8
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:15,390
equal cooperation

9
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:21,100
The Big Boss team is extremely kind and righteous

10
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,100
Very reliable

11
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,230
Our side

12
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,550
Not bad either

13
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:28,550
Then formalize the alliance

14
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:29,550
sign a contract

15
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:42,530
It's ok to be more formal

16
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:43,530
no problem

17
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:58,550
The gatekeeper, Huang Mao, brought someone here.

18
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:00,550
Already driven away by us

19
00:01:00,550 --> 00:01:02,290
No problem

20
00:01:02,290 --> 00:01:04,640
Get some rest tonight
